omy.1.35\">35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:25\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.25\">3:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.21\">4:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.18\">6:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.7\">8:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.6\">9:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.17\">11:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 23:16\" href=\"/Joshua.23.16\">Jos 23:16</a> (D), <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:9\" href=\"/Judges.18.9\">Ju 18:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.8\">1 Ch 28:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אדמה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.15\">1 K 14:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 23:13\" href=\"/Joshua.23.13\">Jos 23:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 23:15\" href=\"/Joshua.23.15\">15</a> (D); <span dir=\"rtl\">הר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:25\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.25\">Dt 3:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חלקה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:19\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.19\">2 K 3:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.25\">25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂדה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.8\">Ez 17:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נָוֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.14\">Ez 34:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מרעה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:40\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.40\">1 Ch 4:40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.14\">Ez 34:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.18\">18</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  of vegetation, <em>choice, fruitful</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">זֵיתִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 8:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.8.14\">1 S 8:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עץ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:19\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.19\">2 K 3:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:25\" href=\